I enter the office.
My colleague Rohan is here.
He smiles.
I say to him, "Good morning, Rohan."
He says, "Good morning, Maya."
I go to my desk.
I place my bag there.
I sit on the chair.
Now I take my computer out of my bag.
I turn on the computer.
I look at the computer screen.
There are many email messages there.
I read the email messages.
Now I write replies.
I type on the computer.
My office day begins.
